# Build output.
#
# The binary names are anchored to the repo root on purpose: an unanchored
# "wayfared" would also match cmd/wayfared, silently excluding the source
# directory that builds it.
/bin/
/dist/
/wayfare
/wayfared
/ladder
/hop-analysis

# Test and coverage artifacts
*.out
coverage.html

# Logs
*.log

# Browser QA harness dependencies (docs/qa/browser)
/docs/qa/browser/node_modules/

# Editor and OS
.DS_Store

# Claude Code configuration is personal tooling, not project content (#571):
# the tracked settings.json pre-approved shell commands for anyone using that
# tool in a clone, so the whole directory stays out.
.claude/

# A PR description that tooling wrote into the workspace reads like project
# documentation but is not (#570).
/PR_DESCRIPTION.md
